- make the common single-source `gbrain dream` path infer and stamp the default source;
- make `autopilot-cycle` reject/avoid non-source-scoped submission when a source table exists;
- improve `doctor` remediation text to point to the exact source-scoped command/job path that updates `last_full_cycle_at`;
- or have `status` surface both notions explicitly: latest completed cycle job vs per-source freshness stamp.

